{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20263ivUOmYXyv1794576250.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>漁護署將於未來兩個周六，就妥善控制狗隻進行特別巡查及執法。</p><p></p><p>署方將於在本月14日及21日，在全港多處特別巡查及執法，如發現畜養人未有按法例要求妥善控制狗隻，署方會即時採取執法行動，不會預先警告，提醒狗隻在公眾地方時，必須以狗帶牽引，或以其他有效方式控制。</p><p></p><p>體重達20公斤或以上的大型狗在公眾地方，必須以不超過兩米的狗帶穩妥牽引，違法可判處罰款及監禁。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T14:02:32.201417+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T11:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T04:12:32.059649+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T13:55:52.028162+00:00","content_hash":"b24812f3903bd660f3b39b1a96b9621cb04fc83ced1e8604c3b88b91f2fd2f77","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T14:02:32.201417+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}